      "changelog": "- Initial release of the `oo-mistral-ai` skill for operating Mistral AI through an OOMOL-connected account via the `oo` CLI.\n- Provides 54 connector actions covering chat completions, agents, conversations, embeddings, FIM completions, OCR, transcription, moderation, models, files, libraries, batch jobs, and fine-tuning job listing.\n- Includes reference docs for every action, with commands to inspect the live connector schema before sending payloads.\n- Supports full lifecycle operations for Mistral Agents, conversations, files, libraries, library documents, shares, and agent versions.\n- Documents safety rules for read, write, and destructive actions, including confirmation requirements before state-changing or delete operations.\n- Adds first-time setup guidance for CLI installation, authentication, Mistral AI connection issues, expired credentials, missing scopes, and billing errors.",
